# Three layers: defaults/communico.toml (shipped, complete, never edited) →
# config/communico.toml (partial overlay, gitignored) → COMMUNICO_* env
# (leaves only). Later wins. Nothing here is required — these lines only
# demonstrate the env syntax. The real environment wins over this file
# (pinned by tests/env-precedence.test.ts).
#
# COMMUNICO_DB_PASS=secret
# COMMUNICO_SERVER_NAME=localhost
# COMMUNICO_SERVER_PORT=8008
# COMMUNICO_PREVIEW_ENABLED=true
